at\n\n$$\n5\\log_{2}\\left(x\\right)+4\\log_{2}\\left(y\\right)=5\\cdot 4+4\\cdot 5=40.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\log_{2}\\left(x^{5}y^{4}\\right)=40.\n$$"] [:db/add "6a155d3c-0437-5bdf-afb1-a5fd32a1ba61" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "6a155d3c-0437-5bdf-afb1-a5fd32a1ba61" :question/answer-fields "4bb7d791-b1a7-5cdf-8702-c1d66906b072"] [:db/ensure "6a155d3c-0437-5bdf-afb1-a5fd32a1ba61" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186054622 :knowledge-point/questions "6a155d3c-0437-5bdf-afb1-a5fd32a1ba61"] [:db/add "28b16e8a-7e2b-54b0-8fc1-d35ecc2d61ec" :answer/id #uuid "28b16e8a-7e2b-54b0-8fc1-d35ecc2d61ec"] [:db/add "28b16e8a-7e2b-54b0-8fc1-d35ecc2d61ec" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "28b16e8a-7e2b-54b0-8fc1-d35ecc2d61ec" :answer/value "18"] [:db/ensure "28b16e8a-7e2b-54b0-8fc1-d35ecc2d61ec" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8169a85e-eb7a-5c34-9cb3-68cfa6f1ebbc" :answer/id #uuid "8169a85e-eb7a-5c34-9cb3-68cfa6f1ebbc"] [:db/add "8169a85e-eb7a-5c34-9cb3-68cfa6f1ebbc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8169a85e-eb7a-5c34-9cb3-68cfa6f1ebbc" :answer/value "33"] [:db/ensure "8169a85e-eb7a-5c34-9cb3-68cfa6f1ebbc" :answer/validate] [:db/add "acd95844-f8e1-5ab3-8022-2795721f5653" :answer/id #uuid "acd95844-f8e1-5ab3-8022-2795721f5653"] [:db/add "acd95844-f8e1-5ab3-8022-2795721f5653" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "acd95844-f8e1-5ab3-8022-2795721f5653" :answer/value "22"] [:db/ensure "acd95844-f8e1-5ab3-8022-2795721f5653" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f399d004-4fb7-595d-b566-82e031606d0e" :answer/id #uuid "f399d004-4fb7-595d-b566-82e031606d0e"] [:db/add "f399d004-4fb7-595d-b566-82e031606d0e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f399d004-4fb7-595d-b566-82e031606d0e" :answer/value "39"] [:db/ensure "f399d004-4fb7-595d-b566-82e031606d0e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0ba57988-9002-55a9-90cb-d6888023eb17" :answer/id #uuid "0ba57988-9002-55a9-90cb-d6888023eb17"] [:db/add "0ba57988-9002-55a9-90cb-d6888023eb17" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0ba57988-9002-55a9-90cb-d6888023eb17" :answer/value "36"] [:db/ensure "0ba57988-9002-55a9-90cb-d6888023eb17" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a0775bf8-2103-5609-b150-1b6fc2e8a958" :answer-field/id #uuid "a0775bf8-2103-5609-b150-1b6fc2e8a958"] [:db/add "a0775bf8-2103-5609-b150-1b6fc2e8a958" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "a0775bf8-2103-5609-b150-1b6fc2e8a958" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "a0775bf8-2103-5609-b150-1b6fc2e8a958" :answer-field/choices "28b16e8a-7e2b-54b0-8fc1-d35ecc2d61ec"] [:db/add "a0775bf8-2103-5609-b150-1b6fc2e8a958" :answer-field/choices "8169a85e-eb7a-5c34-9cb3-68cfa6f1ebbc"] [:db/add "a0775bf8-2103-5609-b150-1b6fc2e8a958" :answer-field/choices "acd95844-f8e1-5ab3-8022-2795721f5653"] [:db/add "a0775bf8-2103-5609-b150-1b6fc2e8a958" :answer-field/choices "f399d004-4fb7-595d-b566-82e031606d0e"] [:db/add "a0775bf8-2103-5609-b150-1b6fc2e8a958" :answer-field/choices "0ba57988-9002-55a9-90cb-d6888023eb17"] [:db/add "a0775bf8-2103-5609-b150-1b6fc2e8a958" :answer-field/correct "acd95844-f8e1-5ab3-8022-2795721f5653"] [:db/ensure "a0775bf8-2103-5609-b150-1b6fc2e8a958" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "31f7c11e-ddce-52f3-9df1-4a9dbff26cc2" :question/id #uuid "31f7c11e-ddce-52f3-9df1-4a9dbff26cc2"] [:db/add "31f7c11e-ddce-52f3-9df1-4a9dbff26cc2" :question/problem "If $\\log_{2}\\left(x\\right)=5$ and $\\log_{2}\\left(y\\right)=4$, then $\\log_{2}\\left(x^{2}y^{3}\\right)=$"] [:db/add "31f7c11e-ddce-52f3-9df1-4a9dbff26cc2" :question/worked-solution "The laws of logarithms are:\n\n- $\\log_n(a)+\\log_n(b)=\\log_n(ab)$ - the product rule\n\n- $\\log_n(a)-\\log_n(b)=\\log_n(\\frac{a}{b})$ - the quotient rule\n\n- $\\log_n(c^m)=m\\log_n(c)$ - the power rule\n\nNote that $\\log_{2}\\left(x^{2}y^{3}\\right)$ can be rewritten using the product and power rules as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\log_{2}\\left(x^{2}y^{3}\\right) &=\\log_{2}\\left(x^{2}\\right)+\\log_{2}\\left(y^{3}\\right) \\\\ &=2\\log_{2}\\left(x\\right)+3\\log_{2}\\left(y\\right)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since $\\log_{2}\\left(x\\right)=5$ and $\\log_{2}\\left(y\\right)=4$, we conclude that\n\n$$\n2\\log_{2}\\left(x\\right)+3\\log_{2}\\left(y\\right)=2\\cdot 5+3\\cdot 4=22.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\log_{2}\\left(x^{2}y^{3}\\right)=22.\n$$"] [:db/add "31f7c11e-ddce-52f3-9df1-4a9dbff26cc2" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "31f7c11e-ddce-52f3-9df1-4a9dbff26cc2" :question/answer-fields "a0775bf8-2103-5609-b150-1b6fc2e8a958"] [:db/ensure "31f7c11e-ddce-52f3-9df1-4a9dbff26cc2" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186054622 :knowledge-point/questions "31f7c11e-ddce-52f3-9df1-4a9dbff26cc2"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "33a4cdc9-e943-50f2-abcd-36b03a740756"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/script "generators/ea/ea5bf4c583efd1a855456476011fb40fd7bca88355902fc4c7a666a189b4df9f/generator.py"] [:db/add 17592186054622 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] [:db/ensure 17592186054622 :knowledge-point/validate]]
